            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your review, Madi! We're thrilled that you found our house clean, spacious, and even better than the pictures. It's wonderful to hear that you had plenty of room to spread out and enjoy your stay. We appreciate your compliments on our easy check-in process and prompt responses. We look forward to hosting you again in the future.",
