        ],
        "text": "The house was very clean and spacious. A lot of the homes available to rent around this area offer 3 and 4 bedrooms, but they are in very close proximity, not giving family much room to spread out. This house was perfect and we had more room than we imagined we needed! Pictures represent the home well and I would say the home is even better in person. Easy check in process and quick responses when needed. Would certainly stay here again.",
